{"route":"/docs/4.6/getting-started/webpack/","version":"4.6","renderedVersion":"4.6","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Webpack","level":1},"lead":{"id":"page--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"<a href=\"https://github.com/twbs/bootstrap/blob/v4.6.2/site/content/docs/4.6/getting-started/webpack.md\">View on GitHub</a>"},"blocks":[{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Learn how to include Bootstrap in your project using Webpack."},{"id":"installing-bootstrap","type":"heading","en":"Installing Bootstrap","level":2},{"id":"installing-bootstrap--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"<a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/getting-started/download/#npm\">Install bootstrap</a> as a Node.js module using npm."},{"id":"importing-javascript","type":"heading","en":"Importing JavaScript","level":2},{"id":"importing-javascript--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Import <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/getting-started/javascript/\">Bootstrap’s JavaScript</a> by adding this line to your app’s entry point (usually <code>index.js</code> or <code>app.js</code>):"},{"id":"importing-javascript--code-1","type":"code","value":"import 'bootstrap';","language":"js"},{"id":"importing-javascript--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Alternatively, you may <strong>import plugins individually</strong> as needed:"},{"id":"importing-javascript--code-2","type":"code","value":"import 'bootstrap/js/dist/util';\nimport 'bootstrap/js/dist/alert';\n...","language":"js"},{"id":"importing-javascript--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"Bootstrap depends on <a href=\"https://jquery.com/\">jQuery</a> and <a href=\"https://github.com/floating-ui/popper-docs/blob/main/docs/v1/index.md\">Popper</a>,\nwhich are specified in the <code>peerDependencies</code> property; this means that you will have to make sure to add both of them\nto your <code>package.json</code> using <code>npm install --save jquery popper.js</code>."},{"id":"importing-styles","type":"heading","en":"Importing Styles","level":2},{"id":"importing-precompiled-sass","type":"heading","en":"Importing Precompiled Sass","level":3},{"id":"importing-precompiled-sass--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"To enjoy the full potential of Bootstrap and customize it to your needs, use the source files as a part of your project’s bundling process."},{"id":"importing-precompiled-sass--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"First, create your own <code>_custom.scss</code> and use it to override the <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/getting-started/theming/\">built-in custom variables</a>. Then, use your main Sass file to import your custom variables, followed by Bootstrap:"},{"id":"importing-precompiled-sass--code-1","type":"code","value":"@import \"custom\";\n@import \"~bootstrap/scss/bootstrap\";","language":"scss"},{"id":"importing-precompiled-sass--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"For Bootstrap to compile, make sure you install and use the required loaders: <a href=\"https://github.com/webpack-contrib/sass-loader\">sass-loader</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/webpack-contrib/postcss-loader\">postcss-loader</a> with <a href=\"https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer#webpack\">Autoprefixer</a>. With minimal setup, your webpack config should include this rule or similar:"},{"id":"importing-precompiled-sass--code-2","type":"code","value":"...\n{\n  test: /\\.(scss)$/,\n  use: [{\n    loader: 'style-loader', // inject CSS to page\n  }, {\n    loader: 'css-loader', // translates CSS into CommonJS modules\n  }, {\n    loader: 'postcss-loader', // Run postcss actions\n    options: {\n      plugins: function () { // postcss plugins, can be exported to postcss.config.js\n        return [\n          require('autoprefixer')\n        ];\n      }\n    }\n  }, {\n    loader: 'sass-loader' // compiles Sass to CSS\n  }]\n},\n...","language":"js"},{"id":"importing-compiled-css","type":"heading","en":"Importing Compiled CSS","level":3},{"id":"importing-compiled-css--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Alternatively, you may use Bootstrap’s ready-to-use CSS by simply adding this line to your project’s entry point:"},{"id":"importing-compiled-css--code-1","type":"code","value":"import 'bootstrap/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css';","language":"js"},{"id":"importing-compiled-css--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"In this case you may use your existing rule for <code>css</code> without any special modifications to webpack config, except you don’t need <code>sass-loader</code> just <a href=\"https://github.com/webpack-contrib/style-loader\">style-loader</a> and <a href=\"https://github.com/webpack-contrib/css-loader\">css-loader</a>."},{"id":"importing-compiled-css--code-2","type":"code","value":"...\nmodule: {\n  rules: [\n    {\n      test: /\\.css$/,\n      use: ['style-loader', 'css-loader']\n    }\n  ]\n}\n...","language":"js"}],"demos":[],"nav":[{"en":"Getting started","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/getting-started/introduction/"},{"en":"Introduction","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/getting-started/introduction/"},{"en":"Download","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/getting-started/download/"},{"en":"Contents","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/getting-started/contents/"},{"en":"Browsers & devices","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/getting-started/browsers-devices/"},{"en":"JavaScript","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/getting-started/javascript/"},{"en":"Theming","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/getting-started/theming/"},{"en":"Build tools","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/getting-started/build-tools/"},{"en":"Webpack","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/getting-started/webpack/"},{"en":"Accessibility","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/getting-started/accessibility/"},{"en":"Layout","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/layout/overview/"},{"en":"Content","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/content/reboot/"},{"en":"Components","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/components/alerts/"},{"en":"Utilities","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/utilities/borders/"},{"en":"Extend","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/extend/approach/"},{"en":"Migration","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/migration/"},{"en":"About","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/about/overview/"},{"en":"End of Life","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/end-of-life/"}],"standalone":false,"publishedAssets":[{"url":"/docs/4.6/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css","integrity":"sha384-xOolHFLEh07PJGoPkLv1IbcEPTNtaed2xpHsD9ESMhqIYd0nLMwNLD69Npy4HI+N"},{"url":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/jquery@3.5.1/dist/jquery.slim.min.js","integrity":"sha384-DfXdz2htPH0lsSSs5nCTpuj/zy4C+OGpamoFVy38MVBnE+IbbVYUew+OrCXaRkfj"},{"url":"/docs/4.6/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js","integrity":"sha384-Fy6S3B9q64WdZWQUiU+q4/2Lc9npb8tCaSX9FK7E8HnRr0Jz8D6OP9dO5Vg3Q9ct"}],"sourceScripts":["https://cdn.usefathom.com/script.js","https://www.google-analytics.com/analytics.js","https://cdn.carbonads.com/carbon.js?serve=CKYIKKJL&placement=getbootstrapcom&format=responsive","https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/jquery@3.5.1/dist/jquery.slim.min.js","https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js","https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/docsearch.js@2/dist/cdn/docsearch.min.js","https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/assets/js/docs.min.js"],"sourceStyles":["https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css","https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/docsearch.js@2/dist/cdn/docsearch.min.css","https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/assets/css/docs.css"]}
